    I''m interested to find out more.","parentUIDs":[4],"SpeechUID":-1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":9}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":290,"yPos":161},"ID":6,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"[+sympathy]
    It''s beautiful. I can really feel the emotion behind every piece.","parentUIDs":[4],"SpeechUID":-1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":10}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":530,"yPos":161},"ID":7,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"[+cynicism]
